Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Kundane +3"
	SAY DESC "Disfigured as a child, Dramnek Olk was ostracized and ridiculed by his peers. In his loneliness he spent many hours alone on the hills overlooking Trademeet. A nearby wizard, Galloma, discovered the youth and found in him a kindred soul. The two fast became friends; master and apprentice. Galloma died before Dramnek's tutorage could be completed, however, and the youth found himself once more alone in the world. Eventually he crafted this sword, which enhanced Dramnek's weak physical body. 

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Tenser's Transformation once per day (caster level)

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d6+3 (piercing)
Speed Factor: 0
Proficiency Type: Short Sword
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 2" 




